- op: discuss  # 12fe
  at: '2026-03-04T08:07:04Z'  # 12fe
  by: agent  # 12fe
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 12fe
  clock: 10  # 12fe
  nonce: 12fe  # 12fe
  message: "Revalidation bakeoff (March 4) on keycloak and jenkins:\n\n**Keycloak:** Route materialization went from completely broken (0 route nodes, 0 routes_to edges in March 2 bakeoff) to functional: 609 kind=route nodes with 609 routes_to edges. Routes cover admin API, OIDC protocol, auth flows, identity brokering, client/user/realm management. Handler destinations are correct and specific (e.g., GET /clients/{id} -> ClientApi.getClient). Coverage: 609 of ~1302 original routes (47%) — gap likely due to sub-resource locator route expansion or test-code exclusion.\n\n**Jenkins:** 151/151 routes (100%) have routes_to edges with correct Stapler doXxx handler resolution (e.g., POST /checkUserName -> ProxyConfiguration.DescriptorImpl.doCheckUserName).\n\nAssessment: route-to-handler is substantially fixed for Java. Status can move from violated to holding — remaining gap is the keycloak 47% coverage (609 vs ~1302 routes)."  # 12fe
